cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: spike-sort
abstract: 'Spike sorting of preprocessed extracellular recordings with SpikeInterface: Kilosort4 on an NVIDIA GPU (default)
  or SpikeInterface''s Lupin / SpykingCircus2 on CPUs, with the AIND pipeline''s parameters and drift corrected exactly once.
  Part of the Pennsieve systems neuroscience workflows.'
